Prefer interface for extendable object shapes.

ts-1-3:
## Type a utility module

```ts
export function average(nums: number[]): number {
  return nums.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / nums.length;
}
```

### Practice
Export clamp(n, min, max).

ts-2-1:
## Unions, narrowings, generics

```ts
type Result = { ok: true; data: string } | { ok: false; error: string };
function unwrap<T>(value: T | null): T {
  if (value == null) throw new Error("null");
  return value;
}
```

ts-2-2:
## Type a small API client

```ts
type Course = { slug: string; title: string };
async function fetchCourse(slug: string): Promise<Course> {
  const res = await fetch(`/api/courses/${slug}`);
  if (!res.ok) throw new Error("failed");
  return res.json() as Promise<Course>;
}
```

